
## `.gitignore`

For this project, keep it simple:

```gitignore
# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.pyo

# Virtual Environment
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/

# Jupyter Notebook
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# PyCharm
.idea/

# Environment Variables
.env
.env.*

# OS Generated Files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Log Files
*.log

# Temporary Files
temp/
tmp/